          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "O Novo Testamento identifica esse Servo-Salvador como Jesus, o Senhor encarnado (Mt 8.17; 16.21; 27.26,29,31,38,57-60; Mc 14.49,61; 15.27,43-46; Lc 2.14; 18.31-33; 23.32; Jo 1.10-11, 29; 3.17; 12.38; 19.1,7,18,38-41; At 2.23; 3.13; 7.32-33; 8.32-33; 10.43; Rm 4.25; 8.34; 10.15-16; 15.21; 1Co 15.3; Ef 3.4-5; Fp 2.9; Hb 5.8; 9.28; 1Pe 2.22-25; 1Jo 3.5; Ap 14.5).",
